1242
01:27:46,110 --> 01:27:46,890
Thank you.

1243
01:27:49,450 --> 01:27:50,050
Good.

1244
01:27:54,990 --> 01:27:55,590
Rockets!

1245
01:27:56,010 --> 01:27:56,930
