Now, I'm running out of coal.

1251
01:28:09,230 --> 01:28:09,510
Oops.

1252
01:28:12,450 --> 01:28:13,030
Half in.

1253
01:28:13,910 --> 01:28:15,030
That's good, that's good.

1254
01:28:15,190 --> 01:28:15,870
No, that's not good.

1255
01:28:16,510 --> 01:28:16,910
There we go.

1256
01:28:17,810 --> 01:28:18,550
Coke all of that.

1257
01:28:20,070 --> 01:28:20,630
Very good.

1258
01:28:23,430 --> 01:28:26,670
