1273
01:29:15,530 --> 01:29:15,950
Paper.

1274
01:29:15,950 --> 01:29:16,370
Nice.

1275
01:29:16,650 --> 01:29:17,090
Oh, man.

1276
01:29:17,470 --> 01:29:19,250
I'm not gonna run out of this anytime soon.

1277
