1278
01:29:27,330 --> 01:29:29,110
The saddles, I mean, fuck off.

1279
01:29:30,090 --> 01:29:32,210
Maybe it's more of a miscellaneous item anyway?

1280
01:29:34,870 --> 01:29:36,590
No, you know, I burned one saddle.

1281
01:29:37,370 --> 01:29:38,470
