1301
01:30:30,210 --> 01:30:32,130
Oh, I was gonna do it.

1302
01:30:32,230 --> 01:30:32,930
I was gonna do it.

1303
01:30:33,490 --> 01:30:34,050
Don't worry.

1304
01:30:34,650 --> 01:30:36,390
I promise I was gonna do it.

1305
01:30:36,790 --> 01:30:37,890
But yeah, five minute break.

1306
01:30:38,010 --> 01:30:38,330
Be right back.

1307
