I got ready a little faster than expected.

1308
01:35:06,720 --> 01:35:07,620
I took the pill.

1309
01:35:07,840 --> 01:35:09,240
I ate some water.

1310
01:35:12,300 --> 01:35:13,240
And... yeah.

1311
01:35:13,820 --> 01:35:15,260
Man, I really hope I'm not getting sick.

1312
01:35:15,360 --> 01:35:16,560
