1313
01:35:19,400 --> 01:35:19,940
Let's see.

1314
01:35:22,680 --> 01:35:23,460
Oh, that was funny.

1315
01:35:23,520 --> 01:35:25,340
I paused right in the middle of the chest closing.

1316
01:35:25,780 --> 01:35:26,380
