1321
01:35:33,920 --> 01:35:34,220
Good.

1322
01:35:35,720 --> 01:35:36,940
Deposit sugar cane.

1323
01:35:37,600 --> 01:35:39,620
And I was cleaning up this chest a little bit.

1324
01:35:39,960 --> 01:35:43,340
Of course I got a little distracted and I decided I needed to do this now.

1325
01:35:43,760 --> 01:35:45,060
Because it was bothering me.

1326
