1329
01:35:52,460 --> 01:35:54,100
When am I ever gonna need that, right?

1330
01:35:54,240 --> 01:35:55,440
We gotta be realistic here.

1331
01:35:56,440 --> 01:35:56,740
Nope.

1332
01:35:56,960 --> 01:35:57,620
Never gonna need it.

1333
01:35:57,760 --> 01:35:58,540
Never gonna need that.

1334
01:35:59,200 --> 01:35:59,800
