1346
01:36:29,720 --> 01:36:31,060
Paper, put it in here.

1347
01:36:33,520 --> 01:36:34,400
Let me see here.

1348
01:36:35,820 --> 01:36:38,060
This inch... oh man, what was it called again?

1349
