2716
03:01:34,800 --> 03:01:35,700
This is what we need.

2717
03:01:43,610 --> 03:01:44,490
Close this off.

2718
03:01:47,530 --> 03:01:48,410
This should work now.

2719
03:01:49,270 --> 03:01:51,770
Again, the problem is to lure them in here, right?

2720
03:01:51,850 --> 03:01:53,230
That's like the big problem.

2721
03:01:57,370 --> 03:02:07,950
And I guess at this point, maybe I don't even need these activations, because if I just leave them open, as long as it's in a crisscross pattern, they're going to try and move around it, and they're going to accidentally fall.

2722
03:02:12,910 --> 03:02:17,570
Especially because... Yeah, the delay here should be max.

2723
03:02:20,010 --> 03:02:20,890
No matter what.

2724
03:02:23,030 --> 03:02:24,990
There's no reason to not have that be maximum.

2725
03:02:31,710 --> 03:02:33,670
You know, there's plenty of time to fall down here.

2726
03:02:34,410 --> 03:02:35,450
The flow here is good.

2727
03:02:35,570 --> 03:02:36,430
See how I collect items?

2728
03:02:36,650 --> 03:02:37,110
It's lovely.

2729
03:02:38,930 --> 03:02:39,370
Okay.

2730
03:02:40,850 --> 03:02:44,330
Honestly, I think this design is really good up here.

2731
03:02:47,500 --> 03:02:49,980
I just need to actually have it work.

2732
03:02:50,700 --> 03:02:55,480
Maybe I'll try and leave the game running while I'm standing here.

2733
03:02:55,820 --> 03:02:59,240
You know, just to see if something will happen over time at some point.

2734
03:03:00,860 --> 03:03:03,200
That could be a nice... maybe for an hour.

2735
03:03:03,420 --> 03:03:04,740
See if it collects anything.

2736
03:03:13,180 --> 03:03:13,580
Alright.

2737
03:03:14,920 --> 03:03:16,160
