Don't want gravel.

2756
03:04:22,730 --> 03:04:23,550
Don't want that either.

2757
03:04:24,830 --> 03:04:26,410
Oh, take, take, take this, take this.

2758
03:04:26,690 --> 03:04:27,250
You can have that.

2759
03:04:27,850 --> 03:04:30,110
You can also have... I don't know, maybe that one.

2760
03:04:30,190 --> 03:04:30,470
I don't know.

2761
