2771
03:05:12,270 --> 03:05:13,550
That's another possibility.

2772
03:05:13,550 --> 03:05:18,890
I don't need to have the magma blocks, because they are going to be a pain to find, I think.

2773
03:05:19,770 --> 03:05:21,130
I mean, usually they're in the water.

2774
03:05:21,450 --> 03:05:23,710
