2800
03:06:43,480 --> 03:06:44,780
I could use that color.

2801
03:06:45,620 --> 03:06:46,580
That'd be nice.

2802
03:06:48,160 --> 03:06:48,840
Come here.

2803
03:06:50,860 --> 03:06:54,440
Give me one of these, and give me... Hey, look at that!

2804
03:06:54,940 --> 03:06:56,200
Hey, cornflower.

2805
03:06:57,020 --> 03:06:57,880
Take one of those.

2806
03:07:00,460 --> 03:07:01,120
That's it.

2807
03:07:01,900 --> 03:07:03,540
You already ripped me off enough.

2808
03:07:05,860 --> 03:07:07,120
I'm happy with that outcome.

2809
03:07:11,800 --> 03:07:12,600
Purple dye.

2810
03:07:12,840 --> 03:07:14,000
That's kind of rare, I feel like.

2811
03:07:16,180 --> 03:07:16,980
Goes in here.

2812
03:07:19,640 --> 03:07:20,560
Spruce planks.

2813
03:07:22,380 --> 03:07:22,860
Shield.

2814
03:07:23,500 --> 03:07:23,980
Redstone.

2815
03:07:26,660 --> 03:07:27,580
What do we have in here?

2816
03:07:27,840 --> 03:07:28,840
Sand and glass, right.

2817
03:07:29,660 --> 03:07:30,120
Okay.

2818
03:07:30,860 --> 03:07:31,580
Alright then.

2819
