Magma detected.

2834
03:08:08,860 --> 03:08:09,360
Oh, really?

2835
03:08:09,520 --> 03:08:10,040
Which direction?

2836
03:08:10,760 --> 03:08:11,320
Southwest.

2837
03:08:11,920 --> 03:08:12,200
Okay.

2838
03:08:12,460 --> 03:08:13,040
I'm on my way.

2839
03:08:16,360 --> 03:08:16,980
There it is!

2840
03:08:19,920 --> 03:08:22,000
We're gonna splash down with as much force as we can.

2841
03:08:25,180 --> 03:08:29,900
You have arrived at your disti- Sorry, I didn't mean to drown you there.

2842
03:08:31,600 --> 03:08:32,160
Gimme!

2843
03:08:32,480 --> 03:08:33,720
Ooh, that's instant!

2844
03:08:34,700 --> 03:08:37,340
The fucking helmet is doing work.

2845
03:08:38,700 --> 03:08:40,020
That is lovely, that.

2846
03:08:41,340 --> 03:08:42,240
Hand it over.

2847
03:08:43,940 --> 03:08:46,400
Oh my god, I am burring so hard on the water!

2848
03:08:48,680 --> 03:08:50,280
Wait, don't forget to collect it.

2849
03:08:53,410 --> 03:08:54,470
Oh yeah, this is how you find it.

2850
03:08:54,550 --> 03:08:55,290
Just find portals.

2851
03:09:02,900 --> 03:09:03,680
Grab it.

2852
03:09:04,140 --> 03:09:04,660
Nice.

2853
03:09:05,160 --> 03:09:06,040
Get out of here.

2854
03:09:08,860 --> 03:09:10,200
Look what breath I have.

2855
03:09:11,660 --> 03:09:12,680
It's fantastic.

2856
03:09:14,520 --> 03:09:16,540
See, I can take these and disenchant them.

2857
03:09:16,720 --> 03:09:17,920
They have value to me now.

2858
03:09:18,140 --> 03:09:19,320
64 bamboo!

2859
03:09:20,260 --> 03:09:21,260
That's crazy.

2860
03:09:22,120 --> 03:09:23,220
I'll take that too.

2861
03:09:27,000 --> 03:09:28,580
What am I collecting here, even?

2862
03:09:31,060 --> 03:09:32,020
Dankeschön.

2863
03:09:32,560 --> 03:09:33,420
Dankeschön.

2864
03:09:38,340 --> 03:09:39,760
Now I'm gonna breathe.

2865
03:09:41,860 --> 03:09:42,820
Breathing.

2866
03:09:46,320 --> 03:09:47,120
That's amazing.

2867
03:09:50,040 --> 03:09:50,440
Good.

2868
03:09:51,860 --> 03:09:53,360
By the way, I just had another idea.

2869
03:09:54,820 --> 03:09:56,360
We don't need to fill the entire floor.

2870
03:09:58,780 --> 03:10:01,940
We basically just need a small, like, a kill room, right?

2871
03:10:02,560 --> 03:10:10,360
So what we can do is have a, um... Like, just the center part.

2872
03:10:10,520 --> 03:10:12,340
Like, they're gonna walk from left to right at some point.

2873
03:10:14,760 --> 03:10:16,940
And we don't need to use that much material.

2874
03:10:18,100 --> 03:10:22,100
That will also make it much easier to actually get the items when we need them.

2875
03:10:22,940 --> 03:10:24,660
We gotta transport the items out of there, right?

2876
03:10:25,620 --> 03:10:31,560
Remember, the whole point of doing this is to collect items from the monsters.

2877
03:10:33,600 --> 03:10:34,620
Alright, let's get out of here.

2878
03:10:36,800 --> 03:10:37,220
No?

2879
03:10:38,700 --> 03:10:41,060
There we go.

2880
