2883
03:10:45,900 --> 03:10:46,180
35.

2884
03:10:46,320 --> 03:10:47,400
That should be fine.

2885
03:10:49,140 --> 03:10:49,940
Happy with that.

2886
03:10:54,960 --> 03:10:55,360
Whoa.

2887
03:10:58,780 --> 03:10:59,180
Whoa.

2888
03:11:03,000 --> 03:11:04,440
Oh, that should be fine.

2889
03:11:08,020 --> 03:11:08,860
Look at that.

2890
03:11:09,460 --> 03:11:11,520
Looks like a... I don't know.

2891
03:11:12,820 --> 03:11:14,600
I don't know actually what that looks like.

2892
03:11:14,800 --> 03:11:18,620
Maybe one of those little containers the Ghostbusters used to catch ghosts in.

2893
03:11:20,040 --> 03:11:21,000
But a big one.

2894
03:11:22,600 --> 03:11:22,980
Alright.

2895
03:11:25,960 --> 03:11:27,020
Get down here.

2896
03:11:28,580 --> 03:11:29,280
Ah, fuck.

2897
03:11:29,380 --> 03:11:30,200
Now I already put them.

2898
03:11:30,420 --> 03:11:30,900
Shit.

2899
03:11:39,320 --> 03:11:39,720
Okay.

2900
03:11:39,720 --> 03:11:40,540
Well, that's fine.

2901
03:11:40,900 --> 03:11:41,620
So check this out.

2902
03:11:41,700 --> 03:11:42,380
This is the plan now.

2903
03:11:43,300 --> 03:11:44,880
I'm gonna keep it super simple.

2904
03:11:47,900 --> 03:11:49,020
Ooh, don't fall down now.

2905
03:11:53,010 --> 03:11:54,690
We're gonna do the middle section here.

2906
03:11:56,930 --> 03:11:57,450
Okay.

2907
03:11:58,770 --> 03:12:00,790
Then... this is the kill room.

2908
