Ah, but... issue detected.

2909
03:12:05,610 --> 03:12:14,470
The kill room cannot be bigger than a certain size because the flow... trademark... needs to... work, right?

2910
03:12:14,510 --> 03:12:16,450
And we know that only works in a small enclosure.

2911
03:12:17,010 --> 03:12:17,990
At least I do.

2912
03:12:19,230 --> 03:12:20,890
So for that reason...

2913
03:12:21,820 --> 03:12:23,600
Maybe we go like that instead.

2914
03:12:24,640 --> 03:12:27,380
No, maybe that's a bit too small.

2915
03:12:28,560 --> 03:12:30,500
Say we limit the flow here.

2916
03:12:32,580 --> 03:12:36,260
Welcome, you have now joined the nether when these mobs come through.

2917
03:12:37,940 --> 03:12:38,880
Do this.

2918
03:12:40,160 --> 03:12:41,080
Do that.

2919
03:12:42,860 --> 03:12:44,360
Now we need to make the flow.

2920
03:12:50,320 --> 03:12:51,500
They fall down like that.

2921
03:12:58,640 --> 03:13:01,740
Oh no, I definitely want this to extend all the way to the edge, of course.

2922
03:13:03,700 --> 03:13:04,660
Major mistake there.

2923
03:13:07,160 --> 03:13:08,580
Ah, but I need to grab these.

2924
03:13:09,180 --> 03:13:09,580
Fuck.

2925
03:13:11,180 --> 03:13:12,400
That is so annoying.

2926
