Oh wait, I have stone.

2927
03:13:37,790 --> 03:13:38,190
Shit.

2928
03:13:39,030 --> 03:13:39,590
You know what?

2929
03:13:39,650 --> 03:13:40,630
They're gonna fall down anyway.

2930
03:13:41,530 --> 03:13:43,310
Let's just let them fall and we're gonna grab them.

2931
03:13:45,750 --> 03:13:46,530
Fuck all that.

2932
03:13:49,750 --> 03:13:50,390
Here we go!

2933
03:13:55,630 --> 03:13:56,310
