That wasn't even that fast?

2937
03:14:07,080 --> 03:14:07,660
Uh-oh.

2938
03:14:08,560 --> 03:14:09,180
Uh-oh!

2939
03:14:11,300 --> 03:14:12,260
What the hell, man?

2940
03:14:14,640 --> 03:14:15,740
I was super slow!

2941
03:14:16,040 --> 03:14:17,160
How did I die from that?

2942
03:14:18,400 --> 03:14:19,480
I had, like, no momentum.

2943
03:14:19,620 --> 03:14:19,960
Oh, no.

2944
03:14:20,100 --> 03:14:20,700
No, no!

2945
03:14:21,080 --> 03:14:22,140
No, don't spawn!

2946
03:14:23,080 --> 03:14:23,800
There's children!

2947
03:14:25,220 --> 03:14:25,880
I'm fucked.

2948
03:14:26,180 --> 03:14:26,760
It's over.

2949
03:14:30,150 --> 03:14:30,710
I'm done.

2950
03:14:32,410 --> 03:14:33,070
Get up here.

2951
03:14:35,870 --> 03:14:36,450
