2952
03:14:37,850 --> 03:14:38,230
Fuck!

2953
03:14:39,890 --> 03:14:40,510
I'm dead!

2954
03:14:40,690 --> 03:14:41,470
Just kill me!

2955
03:14:42,330 --> 03:14:42,710
Fuck!

2956
03:14:42,950 --> 03:14:43,490
Where do I go?

2957
03:14:43,570 --> 03:14:44,590
