2958
03:14:46,010 --> 03:14:47,550
Ah, shit.

2959
03:14:48,770 --> 03:14:49,290
Oh, wait.

2960
03:14:49,390 --> 03:14:49,690
It's up here.

2961
03:14:49,850 --> 03:14:50,090
It's up here.

2962
03:14:51,030 --> 03:14:52,270
Run, run, run, run, run, run, run!

2963
03:14:53,710 --> 03:14:54,230
Come on!

2964
03:15:01,360 --> 03:15:02,200
Over here?

2965
03:15:05,040 --> 03:15:05,700
No.

2966
03:15:06,440 --> 03:15:07,060
Here?

