3597
03:55:54,080 --> 03:55:57,620
That's just something so messed up about that.

3598
03:55:58,640 --> 03:56:01,600
Oh my god, Crusher of Orphans.

3599
03:56:03,120 --> 03:56:03,720
Fantastic.

3600
