3602
03:56:10,760 --> 03:56:17,480
I have to say though, during those moments, the first time I started kidnapping, it felt bad inside.

3603
03:56:18,100 --> 03:56:21,160
Like, I may have seemed joyful about it, but I was dying on the inside.

3604
03:56:21,180 --> 03:56:24,680
I felt like I was crossing a barrier I couldn't reverse from.

3605
03:56:25,440 --> 03:56:26,600
Like I had changed.

3606
03:56:27,280 --> 03:56:28,760
I'm no longer the same man.

3607
03:56:29,620 --> 03:56:32,280
I had become something that I always feared I would become.

3608
