In fact, I'm glad.

3612
03:56:43,600 --> 03:56:46,560
I look at it and I smile with satisfaction.

3613
03:56:50,010 --> 03:56:50,730
Total lie.

3614
03:56:50,870 --> 03:56:51,450
It was not a lie.

3615
