Asparagus, thank you.

3698
04:00:49,970 --> 04:00:50,770
Asparagus, yes.

3699
04:00:54,470 --> 04:00:55,830
The age-old trio.

3700
04:00:56,750 --> 04:00:58,170
Potatoes, meat, and asparagus.

3701
