3711
04:01:16,790 --> 04:01:17,670
I want steak.

3712
04:01:17,670 --> 04:01:18,870
It's not a steak, unfortunately.

3713
04:01:18,970 --> 04:01:21,870
It's, uh... Well, what is the word?

3714
04:01:21,990 --> 04:01:23,230
It's a, um...

3715
04:01:25,820 --> 04:01:28,500
The one from my... fuck.

3716
04:01:29,260 --> 04:01:29,620
Mutton.

3717
04:01:29,720 --> 04:01:30,120
It's a mutton.

3718
04:01:33,440 --> 04:01:34,860
Yeah, it does make your piece stink.

3719
04:01:35,020 --> 04:01:35,260
Really?

3720
04:01:36,080 --> 04:01:36,400
Huh.

3721
04:01:37,020 --> 04:01:37,380
Interesting.

3722
04:01:45,840 --> 04:01:47,760
Oliver, check game to make sure you're actually FK.

3723
04:01:47,880 --> 04:01:48,680
I think you went title screen.

3724
04:01:48,740 --> 04:01:50,260
No, no, I closed the game.

3725
04:01:52,930 --> 04:01:56,970
So it is... It is not open.

3726
04:01:57,250 --> 04:01:58,070
It's on purpose.

3727
04:02:00,210 --> 04:02:00,870
I don't know.

3728
04:02:00,950 --> 04:02:02,570
I didn't trust being AFK in the game.

3729
04:02:02,830 --> 04:02:03,350
You know?

3730
04:02:04,050 --> 04:02:05,310
Who knows what could have happened.

3731
04:02:07,730 --> 04:02:09,450
I did not watch the Minecraft movie.

3732
04:02:10,870 --> 04:02:13,070
But I probably will when it comes out on streaming.

3733
04:02:16,290 --> 04:02:22,090
Just to be in line with all the memes so I can understand what all the kids are talking about, you know?

3734
04:02:23,270 --> 04:02:29,770
I've already been influenced by it indirectly by something called Chicken Jockey and I have no idea... Yeah, exactly.

3735
04:02:29,770 --> 04:02:30,950
I don't even know what it means.

3736
04:02:32,110 --> 04:02:36,490
Is that like a weird reference to some age-old thing in Minecraft?

3737
04:02:46,490 --> 04:02:49,930
When you see a chicken jockey in game, you know chat is gonna be crazy.

3738
04:02:50,090 --> 04:02:51,170
I feel like you're just trolling me now.

3739
04:02:53,690 --> 04:02:55,390
What the fuck is happening here?

3740
04:02:58,630 --> 04:02:59,710
Alright, you know what?

3741
04:02:59,790 --> 04:03:00,930
I think it's time to stop.

3742
04:03:02,110 --> 04:03:03,410
It's time to stop!

3743
04:03:04,030 --> 04:03:04,710
No more.

3744
04:03:05,030 --> 04:03:05,990
This is getting too weird.

3745
04:03:07,410 --> 04:03:11,570
I'm not edgy and young enough for this, you know?

3746
04:03:12,490 --> 04:03:14,750
I'm an old man at this point.

3747
04:03:17,030 --> 04:03:18,190
I'm not disappointed.

3748
04:03:18,490 --> 04:03:18,910
I'm mad.

3749
04:03:21,150 --> 04:03:21,590
Stop!

3750
04:03:23,610 --> 04:03:24,870
I'm just not gonna watch it.

3751
04:03:24,890 --> 04:03:25,790
It's not interesting to me.

3752
04:03:25,910 --> 04:03:26,310
That's fair.

3753
04:03:28,950 --> 04:03:30,530
The overworld?

3754
04:03:35,560 --> 04:03:36,540
Go wash your bread?

3755
