3758
04:03:42,340 --> 04:03:45,040
You guys have always made fun of that, like it's some kind of weird thing.

3759
04:03:46,220 --> 04:03:50,120
Little do you know, in Italy, they do it all the time.

3760
04:03:50,960 --> 04:03:53,360
And I would know, because I've dated someone from Italy.

3761
04:03:54,300 --> 04:03:55,460
Her mom did it too.

3762
04:03:56,640 --> 04:03:57,740
It's a real thing.

3763
04:03:58,500 --> 04:04:00,960
You guys talk like it's a joke or something.

3764
04:04:04,360 --> 04:04:12,620
On the packaging in Denmark, when you buy pizza bread, you know the ones you put vegetables in, some minced meat, spicy sauce, all that?

3765
04:04:13,040 --> 04:04:18,720
On the packaging, it says, wash the bread before putting it in the oven.

3766
04:04:18,940 --> 04:04:20,060
I shit you not.

3767
04:04:22,020 --> 04:04:25,960
